e relaxed by the music\nCalmed by the sounds of nature, rain or waves (headphones recommended)\nGrab and manipulate pieces with ease\n\n***Add Photos***\nAdd custom scenes - thousands freely available online:\nSee: www.JumbliVR.com/photos\n\nCustom scenes should be saved as an equirectangular .png file, sized at 4096 x 2048.", "short_description": "Relax while completing beautifully detailed spherical jigsaws. The new way to experience a traditional puzzle. Suitable for all ages with between 8 and 162 pieces. Add custom scenes - thousands freely available online."}]}, "developer_name": "JumbliVR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.jumblivr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.jumblivr.com/terms/", "publisher_name": "Head Start Design", "support_website_url": "http://www.jumblivr.com/21_connect/", "website_url": "http://www.jumblivr.com/519_jigsaw_360/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL", "PUZZLE", "RELAXATION_MEDITATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "668532630842458"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 15, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "5114026031956218"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3789354737746952"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "560507321423395"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2520661314869806"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "441898156639622"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "203421260982247"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2414894891919656"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "501787223767711"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED"